                            <!-- Task 28: sized/positioned to match SplashScreen's (lib/features/splash/presentation/splash_screen.dart)
                                 badge — 92x92pt, horizontally centered, vertically 63pt above true
                                 center (computed from that widget's own layout: a 260pt RadarPulse
                                 box holding the badge, 30+52+12+2+12+18=126pt of text below it, all
                                 centered as one block in the full screen height). Re-running
                                 `dart run flutter_native_splash:create` regenerates this storyboard
                                 from scratch and resets these two constraints back to dead-center —
                                 reapply centerX/centerY exactly as below if that happens.
                                 Task 41: image itself is assets/icons/splash_icon.png now (a
                                 tightly-cropped, single-solid-color export) — still sized to this
                                 same 92pt box via scaleAspectFit. -->
                            <constraint firstItem="YRO-k0-Ey4" firstAttribute="width" secondItem="YRO-k0-Ey4" secondAttribute="height" multiplier="1:1" id="a1w-92-eq1"/>
